From 1cb0418243f9ce67b06c40876d19168bdaf68660 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Egor <egor.su.8@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:25:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 02/15] mido: sepolicy: Use Miku sepolicy and add Lineage HAL
 compat bits

Miku's common policy only covers lineage touch (HIDL), fod and camera
motor. Add the health, livedisplay and AIDL touch pieces mido needs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 BoardConfig.mk                                |  9 +++++++-
 device.mk                                     |  1 +
 sepolicy/miku/dynamic/hal_lineage_health.te   |  4 ++++
 .../miku/dynamic/hal_lineage_livedisplay.te   |  4 ++++
 sepolicy/miku/dynamic/hal_lineage_touch.te    |  2 ++
 sepolicy/miku/dynamic/service_contexts        | 18 +++++++++++++++
 sepolicy/miku/private/platform_app.te         |  1 +
 sepolicy/miku/private/system_app.te           |  1 +
 sepolicy/miku/private/system_server.te        |  2 ++
 sepolicy/miku/public/attributes               |  3 +++
 sepolicy/miku/public/service.te               |  3 +++
 sepolicy/miku/vendor/file_contexts            |  3 +++
 .../miku/vendor/hal_lineage_health_default.te | 10 +++++++++
 .../vendor/hal_lineage_livedisplay_qti.te     | 22 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../miku/vendor/hal_lineage_touch_default.te  |  1 +
 15 files changed, 83 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 sepolicy/miku/dynamic/hal_lineage_health.te
